 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 61,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Sashakt Panchayat-Netri Abhiyan (MoPR):** a capacity-building campaign that **strengthens the participation and leadership of elected women representatives**, so that they, not male relatives, run the panchayat."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 63,
   "sec": 0,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Articles for simultaneous polls:** **Art. 83** = duration of the Houses of Parliament; **Art. 85** = sessions and dissolution of Parliament; **Art. 172** = duration of State Legislatures; **Art. 174** = their sessions and dissolution; **Art. 356** = President's Rule."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 63,
   "sec": 0,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Qualification vs disqualification:** **Art. 84** = qualifications for membership of Parliament, **Art. 102** = disqualifications for Parliament; **Art. 173** and **Art. 191** = the same for State Legislatures."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 63,
   "sec": 1,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Constituencies:** Lok Sabha and State Assembly members are elected directly from **single-member territorial constituencies** by first-past-the-post."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 63,
   "sec": 4,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Nodal ministry:** delimitation work of the Union is handled by the **Ministry of Law and Justice** (Legislative Department), which notifies the Delimitation Commission."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 63,
   "sec": 10,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Who registers parties:** under **Sec. 29A, RPA 1951**, an association applies to the **Election Commission of India**, which registers it as a political party."
  }
 ],
